# CREDITS — Heat Leaves

A 39-second film in the Chalkboard style, made entirely in code.
The classroom, the lesson and the story are invented: no real school, textbook or brand is portrayed.

## Voice
Speech synthesis: Kokoro (kokoro-onnx), voice `af_heart`, English. Model and engine
are released under the licences of the kokoro-onnx project
(https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). Offline synthesis.

## Music
Original score, written for this film (`music/score.py`).
Nylon guitar and pizzicato bass are physically modelled (`core/audio/pluck.py`).
Marimba notes are samples.

Samples (CC0): Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios).

## Typefaces
- Cormorant Garamond — SIL Open Font License 1.1, Christian Thalmann (Catharsis Fonts). See `fonts/OFL.txt`.

## Picture
Every frame is drawn with this film's chalk engine (`chalk.js`, `letters.js`, `stage.js`).
No stock footage, no photographs, no third-party images.

## Sound effects
Chalk, the felt wipe, the distant bell, the whip and the clock tick are synthesised
for this film (`mix.py`). No recorded chalk samples.
